  abilityId: 1820678
  abilityName: 'Control: System Overflow'
  abilityDesc: 32 combo massive Water attack on single foe, 3 combo powerful Water
    attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP), casts stealth on self boosting
    own Atk and critical hit rate for 2 turns, enormously boosts Spark damage for
    3 turns, boosts own Spark damage for 3 turns & greatly boosts critical damage
    for 3 turns
